  "body_html": "<h1>Convex Game Nash Variational Characterization</h1>\n<p>For a convex game, define\n$$\n  \\Phi(s,t)=\\sum_i G_i(s_i,t_{-i}).\n$$\nThen $t$ is a Nash equilibrium if and only if\n$$\n  \\Phi(s,t)\\le \\Phi(t,t)\n  \\quad\\text{for every }s\\in S.\n$$</p>",
